   <h2>My software</h2>
   
   <div> 
      <p>Over the years, Iʼve written quite a lot of software in various languages and
      for various platforms. In the early years, I was writing desktop software mostly
      for Windows (although it all runs on Linux under Wine), but in the last few years
      Iʼve been working more on web applications in the realm of digital humanities. 
      These are some of the software projects Iʼve worked on, along with information 
      on their current status.</p>
      
